q01_doplata (e = ex_p3) [ul15_hypo = netted]: ?"Did this payer reduce each advance by 1/12 of the kwota zmniejszająca podatek (PIT-2 statement, art. 32 ust. 3 pkt 5; for a pension, the organ rentowy)?" (pit2[ex_p3, job1], pit2[ex_p3, pension]) ?"What advance did this payer collect in this month of January-June 2022? The rolowanie regulation (the lower of the advance under the 2022 and the 2021 rules) is not in the sources." (adv_raw[ex_p3, job1, 2022-01], adv_raw[ex_p3, job1, 2022-02], adv_raw[ex_p3, job1, 2022-03], adv_raw[ex_p3, job1, 2022-04], adv_raw[ex_p3, job1, 2022-05], adv_raw[ex_p3, job1, 2022-06], adv_raw[ex_p3, pension, 2022-01], adv_raw[ex_p3, pension, 2022-02], adv_raw[ex_p3, pension, 2022-03], adv_raw[ex_p3, pension, 2022-04], adv_raw[ex_p3, pension, 2022-05], adv_raw[ex_p3, pension, 2022-06]) ?"What is the ulga dla pracowników of art. 26 ust. 1 pkt 2aa and ust. 4a-4c, in the wording of Dz.U. 2021 poz. 2105 in force on 30 June 2022, on this person's 2022 employment revenue? That text is not among the case's sources." (ulga_prac[ex_p3]) ?"What share of the gross pay are the employee's social insurance contributions (emerytalne, rentowe, chorobowe) that the employer deducts (art. 26 ust. 1 pkt 2; art. 32 ust. 2)?" (zus_rate)
